#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset.md:3
#: 55d6cdc000554136bd91810406c95dfc
msgid ""
"`生成数据集` 是候选训练结构的生产台。它把“扩胞、应变、扰动、缺陷、表面、掺"
"杂、磁性设置” 这些操作拆成卡片，让你把一批可信初始结构扩展成候选池。"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset.md:13
#: 8601e95e6f0a4e23ba34bfd6a184a5ee
msgid "它的输出通常还不是最终训练集。更稳的路线是："
msgstr ""
"Its output is normally not a finished training set. Use the following "
"workflow:"

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset.md:15
#: 95cb88c5410241c3b961f3bc52fb64e1
msgid ""
"导入初始结构\n"
"-> 用卡片生成候选结构\n"
"-> 导出候选池\n"
"-> 在 NEP Dataset Display 里清洗异常结构\n"
"-> 采样后送去 DFT\n"
msgstr ""
"Import starting structures\n"
"-> Generate candidates with cards\n"
"-> Export the candidate pool\n"
"-> Remove anomalous structures in NEP Dataset Display\n"
"-> Sample representative structures and send them to DFT\n"

