#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset.md:87
#: 042e40f7304c4d2ebaf698d0fa1b4c42
msgid ""
"`FPS Filter` 适合在候选结构已经基本干净后做代表性采样。它不负责判断结构是否物"
"理合理。"
msgstr ""
"Use `FPS Filter` for representative sampling after the candidate structures "
"are reasonably clean. It does not determine whether a structure is "
"physically sensible."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset.md:89
#: 6cc8ed27da3e4b419708ae28c9594d76
msgid ""
"如果候选池来自强扰动、随机缺陷、表面切片或随机占位，建议先导出候选结构， 到 "
"`NEP Dataset Display` 里清洗，再回来或继续使用 `FPS Filter` 采样。"
msgstr ""
"When a candidate pool comes from strong perturbations, random defects, "
"surface cutting, or random occupation, export and clean it in `NEP Dataset "
"Display` before applying `FPS Filter`."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset.md:92
#: fc4b490ee58544f59e43afc2819fa5b8
msgid ""
"完整流程见 [候选结构清洗后再进入 DFT](../workflows/clean-candidate-"
"structures.md)。"
msgstr ""
"See [Clean candidate structures before DFT](../workflows/clean-candidate-"
"structures.md) for the complete workflow."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset.md:94
#: 1d892d09e5e0465ea68b63e80997c3e5
msgid "保存和恢复工作区"
