#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset.md:96
#: 440f3e8c7ebf464da61a2765c4d39196
msgid ""
"顶部 `Save` / `Load` 会把当前工作区的卡片顺序、参数和启停状态保存成 JSON。 这"
"适合保存一条可复用的生成方案，例如“某个合金体系的缺陷候选池生成流程”。"
msgstr ""
"`Save` and `Load` in the top toolbar store the card order, parameters, and "
"enabled state as JSON. Use this to preserve a reusable generation recipe, "
"such as a defect-candidate workflow for a particular alloy."

#: ../../../Users/superbing/Desktop/Workspace/NepTrainKit/docs/source/module/make-dataset.md:99
#: 9d5102d5d3cc4488a8e0e50f85038477
msgid "保存工作区不等于保存生成结构。结构结果仍需要从卡片导出。"
msgstr ""
"Saving the workspace does not save generated structures. Export structure "
"results from their card separately."

